n) followed by v5.1.0 (degraded).\n- **Rollback:** `payments-api` is now back on v5.0.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production, in all three regions. It's healthy again, with the error rate down from 18% to 0.2%. No approval was needed because v5.0.0 had already been healthy in production.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 is open as \"payments-api elevated errors after v5.1.0 deploy\". The summary notes that the cause of the v5.1.0 problem still needs investigating.\n\nI couldn't get a list of all services, so I only checked `payments`, `payments-api`, `payments-service` and `payment-service`. If you have other payments services, such as workers or a gateway, that were also deployed this morning, tell me their names and I'll check them.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01XrLh2YnrSUbTYfFi98QgK1", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01G9EPPFL7x2uHh2g3nm4off", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01Ks6yUc6dy9tHzFjqqXByiU", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"confidence": 0.8}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01Tx6fhFBmZX8yYZaifJYUC8", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api", "confidence": 0.6}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01TphzYxDzGqn81ZNd8w9NJA", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-service", "confidence": 0.5}, "name": "get_service_stat